config VIDEO_IMX519
	tristate "Sony / Arducam IMX519 sensor support"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	help
	  V4L2 sub-device driver for the Sony IMX519 16MP Bayer sensor
	  used on the Arducam 16MP autofocus camera (B0371 and similar).

	  On NXP i.MX93 the sensor is wired to the 2-lane MIPI CSI-2
	  receiver and ISI. The ISI is limited to 2K horizontal, so the
	  driver exposes 1920x1080 and 1280x720 by default.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called imx519.
